Here is the complete, section-by-section master blueprint of all six sections combining all of your exact conditions and field layouts:
1. Personal Information
 * First Name: One field.
 * Middle Name(s): One field.
 * Surname: One field.
 * Date of Birth: One field.
 * Gender: One field.
 * Nationality: One field.
