4. Educational Background & Course Selection
Section A: Initial Questions & Logic
 * Heading: Matric Status / Current Standing
   * Dropdown options: Select option (default/disabled), Completed Matric, Currently in Grade 12.
   * Logic: If user selects Completed Matric, two sub-sections appear:
     * High School Education History: Name of School, Country of High School, Province/State, Year Completed / Matriculated.
     * Subject Results (Grade 12 Final Year Results): A dynamic table with Subject Name, Results / %, Level, a Remove button for each row, and an Add button at the bottom of the table to add more subjects.
 * Heading: Have you previously attended a tertiary institution?
   * Dropdown options: Select option (default/disabled), Yes, No.
   * Logic: If user selects No, nothing happens / move on. If user selects Yes, fields appear: Institution Name, Qualification / Programme, Year Started, Year Completed, and Current / Final Status (dropdown: Select option, Completed, Discontinued, Transferred), plus an Add button below to add more tertiary educations.
